===Etymology===
{{inh+|es|osp|conejo}}, from {{inh|es|la-vul|cunīclus}}, syncopated form of {{inh|es|la|cunīculus}} originally "burrow", from {{der|es|grc|κύνικλος}}, probably of {{der|es|xib|-}} or {{der|es|xce|-}} origin; compare {{cog|eu|untxi||rabbit}}.

